            "notes": "Always Shield Stampede round 1. This lets you charge into an enemy player or group of players without having to worry about 80% of the abilities that can cancel it, taking 500 damage before you hit the wall, or being booped out of place before reaching a target.\n\nAbilities that can still cancel your charge are Orisa's Fortify (you can still charge her through her javelin spin), Brig's Shield Bash, Rein's Charge, and Mei's Ice Wall.",
