        {
            "id": "b686f250-5261-4bd8-9e5d-ae45a26ff521",
            "build_id": "7ad3d88b-be88-4103-abec-9caba1319c15",
            "round_number": 2,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:15:02.964751+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 2 just get more AP with [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and [Boost Recycler](item_97a47dab-4554-4340-a9ef-f9424210e08b). Keep boost recycler into late game if they have any ability that can stop your charge through the shield (mainly Brig or Orisa). Having the halved charge time also makes the charge cooldown time faster than any of their abilities that can counter it, allowing you the chance to pin them with a second charge a few seconds later.\n\n[Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is also fine if you didn't make much money in round 1.\n\nIf survivability ever seems like an issue, get [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98), but the idea of this build is to stay alive by staying behind your shield and picking them off with fire strikes and charges, rather than using your body as a bullet sponge as much as possible.",
