            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:15:02.964751+00:00",
            "notes": "At round 5 the build can vary depending on what you're up against, though I would always recommend getting [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). Slowing a target with a Firestrike will make pinning them with Charge easier.\n\nIf you are against a team with a lot of spam or continuous damage (Freja, Junkrat, Orisa, Zarya, Sigma, Soldier, D.VA, even Reaper or Phara), get [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5). This will allow you much better survivability in long fights where you should be staying on the objective, and when hitting your Firestrikes it can make your shield nearly unbreakable assuming you're not in a 1v5\n\nIf you are against a tank who ignores shields (Winston or Reinhardt), I'd recommend going for [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f) for the passive healing (also heals you while charging which is nice).",
